# Playwright storage state written by the admin-setup project (auth.setup.ts).
# It contains live authentication cookies/tokens for the admin account, so
# committing it would leak credentials into version control and quickly go
# stale. It is machine-local and regenerated on every run, so it is never
# committed — even locally, as a best practice.
playwright/.auth/
